FINDING (not fixed in this batch, existing R-189 behaviour): SecretStore creates secrets.sqlite3 with the process umask (0644 here). It holds ciphertext + tenant/name metadata only; the runbook requires a 0700 directory / umask 077. Backup written by the tool is 0600.
